{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102717","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102717/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102717/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102717/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102717","id":2845820436,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6K06Gn","number":102717,"title":"Remove scene context from errors/warnings in Jolt Physics module","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-02-11T16:04:44Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T14:34:58Z","closed_at":"2025-02-11T23:02:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102717","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102717","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102717.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102717.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #102638.\r\nSupersedes #102726.\r\n\r\n> [!WARNING]\r\n> This PR is entirely untested as of writing this.\r\n\r\nThis PR removes any mention of specific scene nodes in the various error/warning messages found in `modules/jolt_physics`, due to calls to `Object::to_string` being problematic when using `physics/3d/run_on_separate_thread`.\r\n\r\nThis PR also changes most of these warnings to be `WARN_PRINT_ONCE` instead, since there's no real context provided anymore, and therefore no point in spamming the warning continuously.\r\n\r\nI've also gone ahead and removed most of the errors related to invalid scaling (e.g. scaling a cylinder on anything but its height axis) as previously emitted by the `JOLT_ENSURE_SCALE_VALID` macro, as they were already adding some friction for some users, and without context they're likely to cause even more friction, especially when emitted during runtime.\r\n\r\nNow instead we only do a `WARN_PRINT_ONCE` inside of `JoltShape3D::make_scale_valid` if a significant invalid scale is detected, and only for `DEV_ENABLED` builds. This should allow us to catch these kinds of errors when bugs are reported that suffer from this, but they won't bother end users.\r\n\r\nI've left in the errors for zero-scaled transforms, as emitted by the `JOLT_ENSURE_SCALE_NOT_ZERO` macro, as they will typically cause a lot of problems and thus should be dealt with in some way, which I currently do by just resetting the entire `Basis` to identity. That seems to me like a significant enough of an intervention to warrant emitting an error, even without any context.","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102717/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102717/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}